OutputRoot: /dprhdbds/shared/data/projects_chb/ibp_oral/getpheno_runs
AccessGroup: ibp_oral
Python: /services/tools/conda/envs/GetPheno/bin/python
GetPheno: /dprhdbds/shared/apps/GetPheno/get_pheno.py
